warning[stateful-iterate]: `iterate` on `Iterators.Stateful` hides write to `s`
 --> src/StatefulIteratePositive.jl:5:12
  |
5 |     x, _ = iterate(s)
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^ removes element from `s`
  |
  = why: name without `!` reads as query, but each call consumes element
  = fix: use `popfirst!(s)`: it returns element without state, and throws `EOFError` where `iterate` returns `nothing`; check `isempty(s)` first   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain stateful-iterate
  = note: warn from readability group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow stateful-iterate -- <reason>`

